            is missing from the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/direct+sum"} direct sum
            above, meaning that the spinor quadrilinear has vanishing components in this vector representation, hence that this expression vanishes identically.
          %h2#in_terms_of_cochains_on_superminkowski_spacetimes In terms of cochains on super-Minkowski spacetimes
          %p
            We discuss Fierz identities as identities among multispinorial elements of the
